pported_image_type\",\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_images_strict.py:290:                \"unsupported_image_type\",\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_claude_bridge.py:316:    images = core_te.extract_data_url_images(messages)\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_claude_bridge.py:324:        core_te.extract_data_url_images(\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_claude_bridge.py:335:        core_te.extract_data_url_images(\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_claude_bridge.py:349:        core_te.extract_data_url_images(\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_claude_bridge.py:353:        core_te.extract_data_url_images(\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_claude_bridge.py:360:    images = core_te.extract_data_url_images(messages)\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/docs/adr/0023-claude-bridge-webp-gif-and-zen-quota-resilience.md:7:Пользователи DeepSeek Harness прикрепляют изображения со скриншотами macOS в формате WebP, что приводило к ошибке 400 `unsupported_image_type` на модели `Claude Opus 5.5` из-за ограничения `_IMAGE_FORMATS` в `core/tool_emulation.py`. Последующая попытка продолжить диалог на `MiMo-V2.6-Flash (Zen) Max` завершалась терминальным сбоем `Request quota exhausted. QUOTA` из-за отсутствия маркера `quota exhausted` в предикате `_is_free_quota_error` моста `opencode-zen-bridge`.\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/docs/adr/0023-claude-bridge-webp-gif-and-zen-quota-resilience.md:10:1. В `core/tool_emulation.py` расширить `_IMAGE_FORMATS` и добавить поддержку форматов `image/gif` и `image/webp`. В `_sniff_image_mime` реализовать строгую двухточечную проверку заголовков `RIFF` и `WEBP` (`data[:4] == b\"RIFF\" and data[8:12] == b\"WEBP\"`).\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/docs/adr/0023-claude-bridge-webp-gif-and-zen-quota-resilience.md:15:- Все четыре формата из `KNOWN_IMAGE_MIMES` (PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP) единообразно валидируются на системном уровне ядра.\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/bridges/agy-bridge/server.py:1060:        \"unsupported_image_type\",\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/bridges/agy-bridge/server.py:1779:            raise ImageReject(\"unsupported_mime\", \"unsupported_image_type\")\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/bridges/agy-bridge/server.py:1796:            raise ImageReject(\"unknown_magic\", \"unsupported_image_type\")\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/bridges/claude-p-bridge/server.py:80:        extract_data_url_images,\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/bridges/claude-p-bridge/server.py:330:    return extract_data_url_images(","final_result":true}}}
